{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T22:24:53.885Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Source changes:**\n- `src/core/status/change-locations.ts`: Added `holdsChange` (checks `<changes>/<folder>/.run/approved`, then `<archive>/<folder>`, then `<rejected>/<folder>` with one `fs.stat` each, stopping at the first hit). `changeTrees` only registers a worktree tree—and its folder in `namedByWorktree`—when the worktree holds its change, so a non-holding worktree no longer hides the checkout or stacked copy. Exported `matchesFolder`.\n- `src/core/spec/stack-dependencies.ts`: Imports `matchesFolder` and dropped the local duplicate.\n\n**Test changes:**\n- Updated the two pinned tests (`tests/change-locations-stacked.test.ts`, `tests/serve-sse-worktrees.test.ts`) to give the worktree copy a `.run/approved`.\n- Added `tests/change-locations-holds.test.ts` covering the three delta scenarios.\n\n**Verification:** `node --import tsx --test tests/change-locations-holds.test.ts` passes (3/3), and `pnpm verify` exits 0 (typechecks, build, full suite, lint).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/096-worktree-holds-change/.run/results/1.md`."}}
